ring the quota figures displayed by the chargeback\n54\t  reporting against the actual Kueue quota configuration.\n55\t- Every discrepancy found is documented with severity and reported to the\n56\t  chargeback reporting implementation.\n57\t- The Distributed Workloads team records a sign-off on the quota semantics\n58\t  used by chargeback reporting, or a list of blocking discrepancies that\n59\t  prevents sign-off.\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- HLR-3 (P1): correctness of the Kueue quota side of the current-month\n64\t  consumption-vs-quota administrator view.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f89cd9d2a58aadc","agent_id":"a5ca8a23c3c335e81","session_id":"d5dcf521-f769-4ae5-8dc7-46406c9edf08","uuid":"ed746393-678f-4d42-8a72-2ee2281f968e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:08:07.440Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bba8a8c36c6b5aac","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
