{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-803904d2ca494071","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9018-E002\n3\ttitle: 'GPU chargeback report service: computation, report API, and CSV export'\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9018\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9018-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-9018-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: rewrite\n14\t  fallback_approach: If the metering data schema is still in flux, rebuild the data\n15\t    access layer against the updated consumption contract behind an isolating adapter\n16\t    with contract tests; if the data is not yet consumable, defer this epic and its\n17\t    dependents until the metering strategy lands.\n18\tai_signals:\n19\t  change_specificity: 0\n20\t  pattern_precedent: 0\n21\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n22\t  existing_foundation: 1\n23\t  open_questions: -1\n24\t  external_dependency: -1\n25\t  human_process_gates: 0\n26\t  repo_access: 1\n27\t  architecture_claims: 1\n28\timplementation_type: null\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: Medium\n31\tai_implementability_score: 1\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\tbranch: null\n34\t---\n35\t# GPU chargeback report service: computation, report API, and CSV export\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tDeliver the reporting backend for GPU chargeback: computation of per-project\n40\tGPU-hour consumption over selectable time ranges from the metering data,\n41\tserved through a stable API for the Dashboard administrator view and finance\n42\ttooling, with CSV export. Also surfaces each project's Kueue quota alongside\n43\tmetered consumption so the administrator view can present consumption against\n44\tquota.\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- Data access to per-project GPU-hour metering data per the metering data\n49\t  consumption contract agreed for this strategy (fields, semantics, access\n50\t